   "originalText": "Keys (JWKS):  appleid.apple.com/auth/keys\nAlgorithm:    RS256\nclient_secret: ES256 JWT you sign (.p8 key)\nName + email: ONLY on first login!\nScopes:       name email\nCallback:     POST (form_post)",
